  "description": "Fences is a community fork of Polly, maintained by Brighter Command. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by App vNext or the Polly maintainers. Paramore.Fences is the legacy API from before version 8: a .NET resilience and transient-fault-handling library that allows developers to express resilience and transient fault handling policies such as Retry, Circuit Breaker, Timeout, Bulkhead Isolation, and Fallback in a fluent and thread-safe manner. New code should use Paramore.Fences.Core.",
